{"id":"5654eb61444fbaa6","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset.md","title":"ZFC Rel Cofinal Subset","display":"df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset — ZFC Rel Cofinal Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset — ZFC Rel Cofinal Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset — ZFC Rel Cofinal Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,P,R,p,c\\in V\">\\(C,P,R,p,c\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S(C,P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,P)\n\\land C\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S(C,P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,P)\n\\land C\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cofinality is relative to the declared relation; no free ambient order notation remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,P,R,p,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelCofinalSubset}_S(C,P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,P)\n\\land C\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R)","display":true}],"bytes":920,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset.md|58-df-zfc-rel-cofinal-subset]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","41276343f41b253b"]}